Files derived from Trellis (modified)
-------------------------------------

  workflows/trellis-mattpocock/workflow.md
      Modified from Trellis's native workflow template. The three-phase state
      machine, the [workflow-state:*] contract, the platform routing markers and
      the #### X.Y step structure are unchanged; the prose naming which skill
      each phase loads has been rewritten.

  agents/claude/trellis-implement.md
  agents/claude/trellis-check.md
  agents/claude/trellis-research.md
      Modified from Trellis's Claude Code sub-agent definitions.

  agents/channel/check.md
  agents/channel/implement.md
      Modified from Trellis's channel-runtime agent role cards.

Files copied from Trellis verbatim (unmodified)
-----------------------------------------------

  upstream/**
      Byte-for-byte copies of the Trellis templates that the modified files
      above were derived from, at the version recorded in upstream/VERSION.
      They exist solely as the BASE for the three-way merge performed by
      upgrade.sh, and are never installed into a target repository.

Third-party work NOT redistributed here
---------------------------------------

  mattpocock/skills — https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
      The engineering skills this workflow routes to are NOT included in this
      repository. They are installed separately from their own upstream via
      `npx skills add mattpocock/skills`, under their own license.
